    "Never read since the daemon started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程启动后还没有读到过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No deployment on this Mac yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上还没有部署"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No mooringctl in this app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用里没有 mooringctl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No poll of the M7 has been reported yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有收到读取 M7 的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No router status yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有路由器状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No status from the daemon yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程还没有发来状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nodes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not a supported M7": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不是受支持的 M7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not live: mooringctl stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非实时：mooringctl 已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not live: the latest status cannot be shown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非实时：无法显示最新状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not reading the daemon's status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未在读取守护进程的状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: %@. The exit needs these off; turn them off in the M7's web interface.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启：%@。出口要求这些保持关闭，请在 M7 的网页管理界面里关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: %@; the exit needs these off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启：%@；出口要求这些保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the count is read; read messages in the M7's web interface.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只读取条数；短信内容请在 M7 的网页管理界面查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Console": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开控制台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin the M7 (`mooringctl router pin --interface en9`), store its admin password (`mooringctl router set-password`), and give the daemon the interface.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先固定 M7 的身份（`mooringctl router pin --interface en9`），保存它的管理员密码（`mooringctl router set-password`），再把接口交给守护进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Polled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit Mooring": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 Mooring"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Radio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Received": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retrying in %lld s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 秒后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Router": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SIM": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SIM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secondary carriers counted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 统计的辅载波数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次数据连接时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "State": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status from %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态时间 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7 did not answer on its interface. Check that it is on and that the USB Ethernet adapter is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 在它的接口上没有应答。请检查 M7 是否开机、USB 网卡是否插好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7 did not grant an administrator's session. If its admin password changed, store it again with `mooringctl router set-password`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 没有给出管理员会话。如果改过管理员密码，请用 `mooringctl router set-password` 重新保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7 is unreachable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上 M7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7 refused the login": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 拒绝了登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7's answer could not be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读不懂 M7 的应答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7's answer did not match what this build reads; the daemon's log names the field.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 的应答和这个版本能读的格式不符；守护进程日志里写明了是哪个字段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The M7's own counters (wwan.dataTransferredRx/Tx).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M7 自己的计数器（wwan.dataTransferredRx/Tx）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac could not poll the M7": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 没能读取 M7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon has not reported a poll of the M7 yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程还没有报告读取 M7 的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon reports a deployment, which this build of Mooring.app does not show yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程报告了一个部署，这个版本的 Mooring.app 还不能显示部署状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon reports after its first poll of the M7, which waits while macOS asks you to allow keychain or local network access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程要在第一次读取 M7 之后才开始报告；如果 macOS 正在请你允许钥匙串或本地网络访问，这次读取会一直等着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daemon's document is version %u; this build reads version 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守护进程的文档是第 %u 版；这个版本只能读取第 1 版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device answering at the gateway is not the M7 that was pinned, so no password was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关上应答的设备不是固定过的那台 M7，所以没有发送密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device answering is not an MR7450 speaking the API this build reads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应答的设备不是这个版本能读取的 MR7450 接口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exit, its nodes, users and SIM meter appear once `mooringctl exit init` has created a deployment. Until then the daemon reads the M7 only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口、节点、用户和 SIM 流量表要等 `mooringctl exit init` 建好部署后才会出现。在那之前，守护进程只读取 M7。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gateway is not the pinned M7": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关不是固定过的那台 M7"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain or the kernel's tables failed on this Mac; the daemon's log (~/Library/Logs/Mooring/daemon.log) names the cause.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的钥匙串或内核表出了问题；原因见守护进程日志（~/Library/Logs/Mooring/daemon.log）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The router adapter is not set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器读取还没有配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal state": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "散热状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app carries no mooringctl": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用里没有 mooringctl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This screen fills in once a deployment exists on this Mac. `mooringctl exit init` creates it; until then the console shows the M7 router only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上有了部署后，这一页才会有内容。部署由 `mooringctl exit init` 创建；在那之前，控制台只显示 M7 路由器。"
          }
        }
